«
@@ ΔROOT — the range of the unknowns found by ROOT. Stack: the ROOT call,
@@ quoted, as in the examples of the Equation Library ▶ a list of the
@@ unknowns, each tagged with its name, as lo…hi.
@@ The inputs are the variables of the equations that hold bounds, a…b,
@@ a±b or a±p%, or a value a±σb, taken as the bounds a±√3·b of the
@@ rectangular law of the same standard deviation, the inverse of Bound→σ.
@@ ROOT is run on a grid over the box of the inputs: up to three inputs,
@@ each at its low bound, its centre and its high bound, 3^n runs; beyond,
@@ at the corners of the box and at its centre, 2^n + 1 runs, unless the
@@ global variable ΔROOTFullGrid holds a number other than 0, which asks for
@@ the full grid of 3^n runs whatever n: slower, but searching inside. The smallest and largest values
@@ of each unknown are kept. If each unknown varies in one direction with
@@ each input, they lie at corners and the range is exact; if one of them
@@ is only reached inside the box, the tag says "(inner extremum?)": the
@@ true range may then be wider. Inputs get back their values; the unknowns
@@ keep their central values, and are purged before each run of ROOT.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ Note: a local evaluates a name or a program that it holds, so names are
@@ kept in lists, and only numbers, units and ranges go into locals.
  1 →List
  → drtq
  «
    @ The call apart: the equations, the unknowns, the guesses. Names are
    @ kept in arrays, and arrays inside lists, never alone in a local.
    drtq 1 Get Explode Drop Drop Drop
    Explode Drop 1 →List
    Swap Eval ListExpressionNames Swap Drop 1 →List
    → drtnames drteqv
    «
      @ The inputs: { name low centre high original } for each
      0 Vars
      → drtk drtvars
      «
        1 drtvars Size For drti
          @ A variable of the equations, which is not an unknown
          0 1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj
            drtnames 1 Get drtj Get →Text drtvars drti Get →Text == Or
          Next
          0 1 drteqv 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj
            drteqv 1 Get drtj Get →Text drtvars drti Get →Text == Or
          Next
          Swap Not And
          If Then
            drtvars drti Get Rcl
            Dup TypeName
            If Dup "unit" == Then Drop Dup UVAL TypeName End
            → drtt
            «
              If drtt "uncertain" == drtt "range" == Or drtt "drange" == Or drtt "prange" == Or Then
                → drtv
                «
                  drtv
                  If drtv TypeName "unit" == Then UVAL End
                  If drtt "uncertain" == Then
                    Range→ 3 √ * → drta drtd « drta drtd - drta drtd + »
                  Else
                    →Range Range→
                  End
                  If drtv TypeName "unit" == Then
                    drtv →Unit Swap drtv →Unit Swap
                  End
                  → drtlo drthi
                  «
                    drtvars drti Get drtlo drtlo drthi + 2 / drthi drtv 5 →List
                    drtk 1 + 'drtk' Sto
                  »
                »
              Else
                Drop
              End
            »
          End
        Next
        drtk →List
      »
      → drtin
      «
        drtin Size
        @ The full grid up to three inputs, or when ΔROOTFullGrid asks for it
        IfErr 'ΔROOTFullGrid' Rcl Then Drop 0 End 0 ≠
        Over 3 ≤ Or
        If Then 3 Else 2 End
        → drtn drtlev
        «
          drtlev drtn ^ R→I { } { } { } { }
          → drtcount drtmin drtmax drtfmin drtfmax
          «
            @ Every combination of the levels of the inputs, counted in base
            @ drtlev; with two levels, one run more, at the centre of the box
            0 drtcount If drtlev 2 == Then 0 Else 1 End - For drtc
              drtc 1
              → drtm drtcorner
              «
                If drtc drtcount == Then
                  0 'drtcorner' Sto
                  1 drtn For drti
                    drtin drti Get 3 Get drtin drti Get 1 Get Sto
                  Next
                Else
                  1 drtn For drti
                    drtm drtlev MOD
                    drtm drtlev / IP R→I 'drtm' Sto
                    → drtd
                    «
                      If drtlev 3 == drtd 1 == And Then 0 'drtcorner' Sto End
                      drtin drti Get
                      If drtlev 3 == Then drtd 2 + Else drtd 2 * 2 + End Get
                      drtin drti Get 1 Get Sto
                    »
                  Next
                End
                1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj IfErr drtnames 1 Get drtj Get Purge Then End Next
                drtq 1 Get Eval Drop
                1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj drtnames 1 Get drtj Get Rcl Next
                drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
                → drty
                «
                  If drtc 0 == Then
                    drty 'drtmin' Sto drty 'drtmax' Sto
                    1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj drtcorner Next
                    drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List Dup 'drtfmin' Sto 'drtfmax' Sto
                  Else
                    1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj
                      drty drtj Get
                      → drtv
                      «
                        If drtv drtmin drtj Get < Then
                          drtmin drtj drtv Put 'drtmin' Sto
                          drtfmin drtj drtcorner Put 'drtfmin' Sto
                        Else
                          If drtv drtmin drtj Get == drtcorner And Then
                            drtfmin drtj 1 Put 'drtfmin' Sto
                          End
                        End
                        If drtv drtmax drtj Get > Then
                          drtmax drtj drtv Put 'drtmax' Sto
                          drtfmax drtj drtcorner Put 'drtfmax' Sto
                        Else
                          If drtv drtmax drtj Get == drtcorner And Then
                            drtfmax drtj 1 Put 'drtfmax' Sto
                          End
                        End
                      »
                    Next
                  End
                »
              »
            Next
            @ The central run, so that the unknowns keep their central values
            1 drtin Size For drti drtin drti Get Dup 3 Get Swap 1 Get Sto Next
            1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj IfErr drtnames 1 Get drtj Get Purge Then End Next
            drtq 1 Get Eval Drop
            @ Every input gets back its original value
            1 drtin Size For drti drtin drti Get Dup 5 Get Swap 1 Get Sto Next
            @ The results, lo…hi tagged with their names
            1 drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For drtj
              drtmin drtj Get drtmax drtj Get
              → drta drtb
              «
                If drta TypeName "unit" == Then
                  drta UVAL drtb drta Convert UVAL →Range drta →Unit
                Else
                  drta drtb →Range
                End
                drtnames 1 Get drtj Get →Text
                If drtfmin drtj Get drtfmax drtj Get And Not Then " (inner extremum?)" + End
                →Tag
              »
            Next
            drtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
